{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Hopeless Junction is a remaster of an award winning kinetic visual novel. The story follows a bunch of tgirls on a week-long journey on the world famous transcontinental train, 'The Starline Junction Express'. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>During these seven days on board, when meeting a girl with a mysterious air to her, Kalinda takes the opportunity to try and be bold for the first time in her life. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When the mysterious girl, Zarina, ends up being a mean sadist, what ensues is drunken bullying and sexual chaos that even pulls in Kalinda's closest friend and sister, Chandra, into this confusing whirlpool of conflicting emotions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Weird gay sex, utter confusion, heart wrenching panic and life altering trauma.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please enjoy it.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOPELESS JUNCTION: cuppy dog barf girl and co. Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remastered version of the beloved story, the plot remains the same but many scenes have been fixed up and dialogue improved on. New ones fitted in, too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALL NEW ART! THIS TIME WITH COLOURS AND STUFF! Experience Barf Girl in FULL HD.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scripting improvements left and right! These lil' dorks are coming alive with Ren'Py magic!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly; Finally, <i>Cuppy Dog Plushie Humping</i> epilogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571820/extras/ff5238b56d011e973b85002019b59410.poster.avif?t=1759254684\" width=667 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st